  "analysis": "The malloc disassembly shows a free-list allocator that falls back to `basic_malloc`. I need to see `basic_malloc` to determine if it uses a syscall (brk/mmap) or a static heap. I also need the `default_ram` value from i_system.c. The zone allocation failure is because the custom malloc can't satisfy 25MB.",
